minent human rights lawyer, Inibehe Effiong, has lamented that Nigerians are often distracted with “multiple dramas” instead of holding the government to account. TheTalk.NG reported how music star Innocent Idibia (2baba) confirmed his relationship with the deputy majority ... Read more Continue reading here ▶",
